[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    107[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    108[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Each of these is asserted by the suite.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    109[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
