[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    116[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `strtoul` skips leading whitespace | `" 5"`, `"\t5"`, `"\n+1"`, `"\x0b\x0c9"` are all valid seeds | `full_run::seed_*` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    117[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | …but trailing whitespace is not | `"5 "`, `"5\n"`, `"-0 "` are rejected via `*endptr != '\0'` | `invalid_seed_trailing_whitespace` |
