[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    120[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `ERANGE` vs merely-too-large are distinct paths | `"18446744073709551615"` fits `unsigned long` (no `ERANGE`) yet fails `> UINT_MAX`; `"18446744073709551616"` sets `ERANGE` | `invalid_seed_ulong_range_but_above_uint_max`, `invalid_seed_erange_overflow` |
