[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    126[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Analysis notes
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    127[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    128[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * **`printf("%d")` with a negative value is unreachable.** The kernel's
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    129[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   functional graph has its iterates land in cycles of length 52 330 and 11 991
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    130[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   (tails observed ≈ 3 700–30 000 steps, far below the 200 000 steps the program
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    131[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   performs). Every element of both cycles has bit 31 set — checked exhaustively
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    132[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   over both cycles: `neg=52330 pos=0 zero=0` and `neg=11991 pos=0 zero=0`.
