[38;5;252m[1m## What I found[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The translation was already numerically correct — the glibc [38;5;10mrand()[0m stream, [38;5;10mstrtoul[0m semantics, and the wrapping/shift/truncating-division kernel all matched. [1mOne real divergence:[22m[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mRust ignored [38;5;10mSIGPIPE[0m, C died from it.[22m Rust's runtime installs [38;5;10mSIG_IGN[0m for [38;5;10mSIGPIPE[0m before [38;5;10mmain[0m; a C program starts with the default disposition. With no reader on stdout, the C program is killed by signal 13 (wait status 141) when it finally calls [38;5;10mprintf[0m, while the Rust program's ignored [38;5;10mwrite![0m error let it exit 0. Fixed with [38;5;10mrestore_default_sigpipe()[0m as the first statement of [38;5;10mmain[0m, verified against minimal stand-ins (C → [38;5;10msignal 13[0m, unfixed Rust → [38;5;10mexit 0[0m, fixed Rust → [38;5;10msignal 13[0m).[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Two further red tests were defects in my own harness, not the translation, and are recorded in [38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m so they aren't misread later: a 1 MiB [38;5;10margv[1][0m exceeds Linux's [38;5;10mMAX_ARG_STRLEN[0m so [3mneither[23m binary can be exec'd, and the first [38;5;10mSIGPIPE[0m test used [38;5;10mpipe(2)[0m whose fds aren't close-on-exec, so the child inherited the read end and kept the pipe alive.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Verification[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The workload is 5.24×10¹⁰ arithmetic steps — ~8 min per C run — so I layered the checking:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- **[38;5;10mtranslation/tests/differential.rs[0m** — 61 tests, driving both [3mbuilt binaries[23m as subprocesses and comparing stdout, stderr, exit code and termination signal. [38;5;10margv[0][0m is forced identical via [38;5;10mCommandExt::arg0[0m, since C prints it verbatim. Expensive cases sit in [38;5;10mmod full_run[0m for libtest parallelism; ~13 min wall.[0m[0m
- **Reduced-scale oracles** that regenerate their harness from the real [38;5;10mmain.rs[0m (so they can't drift): the [38;5;10mrand()[0m stream over 20 seeds and the kernel over 28 hostile [38;5;10mint32[0m values (48/48 identical), and [38;5;10mstrtoul[0m value/[38;5;10mendptr[0m/[38;5;10mERANGE[0m/decision over 113 byte-exact inputs (113/113 identical).[0m[0m
